+| `src/lib/studio-agent-preference.ts` | Created |
+| `src/components/StudioWorkspaceV2.tsx` | Updated |
+| `tests/studio-agent-preference.test.ts` | Created |
+
+## Commit
+
+```
+feat(studio): MRU agent selection for canvas default
+```
